      "doc": "Ordering value determining the order of merging on the same key. Position i holds the primitive that Hudi's wrapper record at union position i carries, so narrowing to [null, i] yields a primitive column. This is a lookup table read as JSON, never parsed as Avro, so repeated types are fine.",
